  "prefLabel": "Elec 104.04 Unavailability of Public Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 104.04 Unavailability of Public Records. If the board is unable to make a governmental public record available for immediate inspection and photocopying, then it shall, within 5 business days of request:\n\n(a) Make such record available;\n\n(b) Deny the request in writing with reasons; or\n\n(c) Furnish written acknowledgment of receipt of the request and a statement of the time reasonably necessary to determine whether the request will be granted or denied.\n\nSource. #10354, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13; ss by #10421, eff 9-25-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/elec100-400.html"
